      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCOTT GNARLY (8) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.9 lengths at this track in a handy 30.03 beating Corban Yaxley. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. NEO DEVERE (1) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 6 lengths (29.79) at Sandown in a Grade 5 over 515m. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to be in this for a long way. INDIAN PRINCE (2) turned in a moderate run last time when seventh at Sandown over 515m behind Mepunga Gypsy (30.04) in a Grade 5. Must be included in calculations. MR. FIELD (7) recorded a commanding victory last time. Right in the mix.",
